  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/712667498197155862/988015527710556200/fi_nalacadre_logo.png?width=1025&amp;height=359\" alt=\"\" width=\"1151\" height=\"403\"><br></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/3AvrppcgG3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e7d437cbe00c4c4d693900b0e41e3a293a84a31b.png\" alt=\"Discord 連結\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fto0pa.ovh%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e79bfe6b479f2a23fad07b79b13d88d027ae422e.png\" alt=\"贊助\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;-</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjXvVIzBkFmmGjOBAq-zGIg/channels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/891582128310063164/952947600833777724/youtube.png\" width=\"165\" height=\"90\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/891582128310063164/952947601219665960/discord.png\" width=\"165\" height=\"90\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252funsusualsquad%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/891582128310063164/953302370723463228/reddit.png\" width=\"164\" height=\"89\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;-</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/998210630265872387/1111947255537221673/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" width=\"1213\" height=\"442\"><br><br>不尋常鑽頭為遊戲添加了新的高效工具，可挖掘大面積區域（3x3）（鑽頭、鋸子和鏟子）。每種工具都有 3 個獨特的材料等級，使用海磷石、地獄磚等材料，具體取決於工具！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">（安裝&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>&nbsp;以查看所有合成表）&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>用於合成的基礎工具：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/712667498197155862/966307681755344946/emboutl_render.png\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>鑽頭</strong></span>，<strong>等級 1：</strong>&nbsp;鐵，<strong>等級 2：</strong>&nbsp;海洋之心，<strong>等級 3：</strong>&nbsp;獄髓</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/712667498197155862/966307681495306240/drill_render.png\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">鋸子</span>，等級 1：</strong>&nbsp;金，<strong>等級 2：</strong>&nbsp;地獄磚，<strong>等級 3：</strong>&nbsp;鑽石</span></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/712667498197155862/966307682040545281/saw_render.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">鏟子</span>，等級 1：</strong>&nbsp;竹子，<strong>等級 2：</strong>&nbsp;烈焰桿，<strong>等級 3：</strong>&nbsp;終界棒</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/712667498197155862/966307682317385778/spade_render.png\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;未定義</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>多功能鑽頭</strong> </span>：<strong>等級 1</strong>：惡魂之淚，<strong>等級 2：</strong>不死圖騰，<strong>等級 3：</strong>地獄之星<br></span></p><p><strong>多功能鑽頭可以挖掘所有類型的方塊！</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/922393407802986496/973235819211005982/multidrill_render.png\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>您可以將不尋常鑽頭放入您的模組包中！<br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;未定義</p>",
